# TKickback Space Cadet regression: a ball rests on kickback a_kick1 until the
# 0.7 s arming timer fires, then the next contact kicks it. The upstream sequence must stay
# unchanged; this is an R-seed script (baseline vs candidate byte compare).
# Expected values are what upstream's TKickback produces on the baseline binary: arming sound at
# frame 91 (first contact ~19 + 0.7 s), kick before frame 110.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
init dump_period 100
10 place 0 7.0 11.0 0.37 0 1 3
60 shot resting
88-94 expect sound 13
95 shot armed
115 shot kicked
110 expect n_ball0_speed in 40 70
110 expect n_ball0_y in -1 10
300 quit
